Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Add list and trim correction modules with book-verified
 tests

- New src/list_correction.py: Implements displacement correction for list per Dibble spec 005, ensuring positive sign via absolute differences.
- New src/trim.py: Adds layer, first, and second trim correction functions based on Dibble specs 004, handling LCF offsets and MCTC changes.
- New tests/test_book_verified_examples.py: Validates calculations against specific examples (Questions 3, 4, 5, 7, 8) from the source text to ensure pipeline accuracy.
- New .gitignore: Excludes Python cache files and pytest artifacts from version control.
